          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Allergy testing is required before starting AlleDrops. It confirms which allergens are driving your symptoms so your formula can be built to match them.</p><p>If you already have recent results, submit them as part of the online symptom assessment — no need to start over. If you don't, schedule a telehealth visit and an Allergist on Demand provider can order testing for you.</p><p>For medical emergencies or allergic reactions, call 911. Do not use this page in an emergency.</p>"
